__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Loop run state: machine-owned. Task progress rebuilds from git and tasks.md;
# the objective, the limit budgets, the verify rounds and a recorded halt do
# not - see references/state-schema.md for the bill.
# checkpoint.py stages with `git add -A` when the caller names no paths, so
# without this every task commit would carry a counter bump nobody reads.
.specs/features/**/loop.json
